title: NinethWave
---
<<wait  2>>
Anonymous: Neither of them caused this. #line:S9-01-anom 
Anonymous: But now... #line:S9-02-anom
Anonymous: They must solve it. #line:S9-03-anom
Anonymous: They are both planning something big. #line:S9-04-anom
Anonymous: Which side will you choose. #line:S9-05-anom
Anonymous: When they call back. #line:S9-06-anom
<<start_wave>>

===

title: ScientistPhone
---
<<once>>
    Scientist: This is it! #line:S10-01-scientist
    Scientist: We are so close to finishing the cure. #line:S10-02-scientist
    Scientist: We will give the recipe once we perfect it so you can make it and use it on the infected. #line:S10-03-scientist
    Scientist: But be careful, as I cannot promise your safety when inhaling the cure. #line:S10-04-scientist
    Scientist: We don’t have time to test the results of it. #line:S10-05-scientist
    Scientist: On an uninfected subject. #line:S10-06-scientist
    Scientist: Thank you for everything. #line:S10-07-scientist
    <<start_wave>>
    <<hang_up "scientist">>
<<endonce>>
===

title: Scientist_Cure
---
<<once>>
    Scientist: We got it! #line:S10-08-scientist
    Scientist: We can finally put an end to this! #line:S10-09-scientist
    Scientist: So, turns out. #line:S10-10-scientist
    Scientist: You just need to mix every single ingredient you got. #line:S10-11-scientist
    Scientist: It will take a long time to mix. #line:S10-12-scientist
    Scientist: So prepare accordingly. #line:S10-13-scientist
    Scientist: Good luck. #line:S10-14-scientist
    <<hang_up "scientist">>
<<endonce>>
===

title: ScientistFinal
---
Scientist: It’s working. #line:final-01-scientist
Scientist: The infection is reverting! #line:final-02-scientist
Scientist: Your sacrifice was worth it. #line:final-03-scientist
Scientist: You will be remembered for efforts to save the world. #line:final-04-scientist 
Scientist: Thank you. #line:final-05-scientist
<<hang_up "scientist">>
===

title: MilitarPhone
---
<<once>>
    Military: Soldier, its time. #line:S10-01-military
    Military: We have built it. A flour airstrike. #line:S10-02-military
    Military: We must destroy the infected zone. #line:S10-03-military
    Military: Your food truck will be destroyed in the process. #line:S10-04-military
    Military: Do not threat though. #line:S10-05-military
    Military: we will send a helicopter to rescue you. #line:S10-06-military
    Military: We want you to join our forces. #line:S10-07-military
    Military: Together we can save the people, Catility and the world! #line:S10-08-military
    Military: Get ready and stand your ground while we get there! #line:S10-09-military
    <<hang_up "military">>
    <<start_wave>>
<<else>>
    <<hang_up "military">>
    <<start_wave>>
<<endonce>>
===

title: MilitarFinal
---
Military: We are here! #line:final-01-military
Military: No soldier left behind, get on! #line:final-02-military
Military: They are going to nuke the place! #line:final-03-military
<<hang_up "military">>
